Cat Clip Composer v0.1.17

This extensionless file is the distributable version marker. Its filename must match the application version.

Changes since v0.1.16:
- Added a version_<version> marker beside every GUI and CLI executable.
- Made builds and portable publishing fail when the checked-in marker name does not match the central version.
- Removed stale version markers from reused build and publish output folders.
